# Exceptions to tools/refuse_foreign.py, accepted by a reviewer.
#
# Format: one entry per line, a path, whitespace, then the reason.
#   specs/example/fixture.tdf   text written by hand, no game data
# A path with spaces or other odd characters goes in double quotes (JSON
# escapes), then the reason:
#   "specs/my notes/a b.tdf"   text written by hand, no game data
# The path is the whole path from the repository root, and it is matched
# exactly. An entry allows that path in every commit of a pull request.
# An entry without a reason is an error. Blank lines and lines that start
# with # are ignored. The file starts empty: a fixture a test builds at run
# time is never committed and needs no entry.
